# DataSipper: Comprehensive data storage service
#
# This patch creates a unified data storage service that coordinates between
# SQLite persistence, in-memory buffers, and stream management for optimal
# performance and reliability.
#
# Affects:
# - components/datasipper/storage/data_storage_service.h/cc (new files)
# - Integration of all storage components

